"graph theming" is a notebook page
	<header level="1">
		Graph
		<header>A graph draws nodes joined by edges, laid out left to right. A node may hold a graph of its own, opened in place, in a modal, or in its stead.</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Set a public `--ui-*` token on the element, any ancestor or `:root`; it inherits into the shadow
			root. Edit a value below to try it.
		</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-graph" playground>
				<ui-graph style="--ui-graph-height: 16em" graph="{\"nodes\":\[{\"id\":\"in\",\"label\":\"Input\",\"ports\":\[{\"id\":\"out\",\"kind\":\"out\"}]},{\"id\":\"parse\",\"label\":\"Parse\",\"ports\":\[{\"id\":\"src\",\"label\":\"src\",\"kind\":\"in\"},{\"id\":\"ast\",\"label\":\"ast\",\"kind\":\"out\"},{\"id\":\"errors\",\"label\":\"errors\",\"kind\":\"out\"}]},{\"id\":\"check\",\"label\":\"Check\",\"ports\":\[{\"id\":\"ast\",\"label\":\"ast\",\"kind\":\"in\"},{\"id\":\"ok\",\"label\":\"ok\",\"kind\":\"out\"}]},{\"id\":\"report\",\"label\":\"Report\"},{\"id\":\"emit\",\"label\":\"Emit\"}],\"edges\":\[{\"from\":{\"node\":\"in\",\"port\":\"out\"},\"to\":{\"node\":\"parse\",\"port\":\"src\"}},{\"from\":{\"node\":\"parse\",\"port\":\"ast\"},\"to\":{\"node\":\"check\",\"port\":\"ast\"},\"label\":\"tree\"},{\"from\":{\"node\":\"parse\",\"port\":\"errors\"},\"to\":{\"node\":\"report\"}},{\"from\":{\"node\":\"check\",\"port\":\"ok\"},\"to\":{\"node\":\"emit\"}}]}"></>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling this component through its tokens.  Its colours come from the theme, so it follows
			light and dark mode by itself.
		</>
	</>
